// Package taxonomy tests — T-14 characterization (Phase 1).
//
// THE LAW (roadmap Phase 1 + task list standing orders): the Python
// characterization tests are ported FIRST, then the code; the goldens were
// GENERATED by running the unmodified Python reference app
// (assadigit/GitCurator @ 98f4fc7) via testdiff/goldens/dump_taxonomy.py —
// never hand-typed. Regenerate with:
//
//	python3 testdiff/goldens/dump_taxonomy.py
//
// Ported suite: app/tests/test_phase2.py TestTaxonomyRealFile (all 12
// tests, against the reference's own fixture — copied into testdata by the
// generator). The golden corpus additionally pins: the full parsed model,
// every query surface, every error message byte-exact, the BOM-sig read,
// the UnicodeDecodeError escape (NOT a TaxonomyError), one synthetic
// mini-taxonomy per parser rule, Python str.splitlines()/strip()
// semantics (pySplitLines / pyStrip), and the SHIPPED taxonomy parse
// snapshot (the embedded assets copy — sha256-pinned).
